0016D1r 1               
0016D1r 1               ; the game's pace: speed video frames (the ROM's 60 Hz counter) for 3
0016D1r 1               ; frames, shared out 3, 3, 4 (default 10: 18 frames a second, the
0016D1r 1               ; original's 55 ms), the sound going on meanwhile
0016D1r 1  A9 00        pace:   lda     #0              ; speed / 3, and what is left over
0016D3r 1  8D rr rr             sta     tmp4
0016D6r 1  AD rr rr             lda     speed
0016D9r 1  C9 03        @d:     cmp     #3
0016DBr 1  90 07                bcc     @dd
