0017D8r 1               ; grp[0..7] (field row prow, block pgrp) -> its three cells: columns 1 + 3
0017D8r 1               ; pgrp, screen row prow + 1.  Each character (2 x 4 pixels, bit 2k = row k's
0017D8r 1               ; left pixel, 2k+1 its right) becomes 3 screen pixels across (left, left,
0017D8r 1               ; right at an even column; left, right, right at an odd one) by 8 lines.
0017D8r 1               ; (The colours stay white on black: cls sets them.)
